        en: "Heat 3 tbsp oil in soup pot over medium-low heat. Add blended curry spice paste and 2 bruised lemongrass stalks. Saut\xE9 patiently for 10-12 mins, stirring continuously until the raw spice edge softens and bright red aromatic oil separates on top.",
        ms: "Panaskan 3 sb minyak. Tumis pes rempah kari dan serai titik atas api sederhana kecil selama 10-12 minit hingga terbit minyak merah yang wangi.",
